# Every file in this repository is authored and stored with LF endings.
#
# This is declared rather than assumed because core.autocrlf is enabled on some
# machines, which rewrites the working tree to CRLF on checkout and reintroduces
# exactly the carriage returns the sources are kept free of. Recording the rule
# here makes it a property of the repository instead of a property of whoever
# happened to clone it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Content that must never be line-ending translated.
*.onnx binary
*.nupkg binary
*.snupkg binary
*.db binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
